'''''Thrawn''''' is a [[canon]] novel written by [[Timothy Zahn]] as the first installment of ''[[Star Wars: The Imperial Trilogy]]''. It was published by [[Del Rey]] on [[April 11]], [[2017]]. The novel is about the character [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]], who was canonically reintroduced in the [[Star Wars Rebels Season Three|third season]] of ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''. Zahn was the creator of the [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo/Legends|original character]] in the author's [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] [[Star Wars: The Thrawn Trilogy|''Thrawn Trilogy'']].

The [[Thrawn (audiobook)|audiobook version]] was narrated by [[Marc Thompson]]. In [[2018]], a [[Star Wars: Thrawn (comic series)|''Star Wars: Thrawn'' comic adaptation]] was published, which was written by [[Jody Houser]] and released over six issues by [[Marvel Comics]]. The novel's sequel, ''[[Thrawn: Alliances]]'', was also released in 2018.
